    <string name="settings_skills_auto_title">Auto-save skills</string>
    <string name="settings_skills_auto_desc">After Act / Max finishes a multi-step UI flow successfully, save it as a replayable skill. Identical flows are skipped; up to 20 auto-saved skills are kept. Flows that look like password, OTP or API-key entry are skipped. Off by default.</string>
    <string name="settings_skills_hint">Auto-save records text typed during the flow in the skill; avoid enabling it for password or chat flows. Auto-saved skills can be reviewed, renamed or deleted in Library → Skills. Turning this off does not delete existing skills.</string>

